OL,3,ADeadly shooting near Paris is a 'racist
OL,4,Aterrorist attack', Macron says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe attack unfolded over some 15
OL,7,Fminutes with the attacker opening fire
OL,8,Ffrom his car - first in Trappes to the
OL,9,Fsouth-west of Paris, and then in nearby
OL,10,FLa Verriere - appearing to target
OL,11,Fpeople of migrant origin. He was
OL,12,Fsubsequently arrested.
OL,14,FThree of those injured, including a
OL,15,F12-year-old girl, remain in a serious
OL,16,Fcondition.
